flowchart TD
    accTitle: ZETTINGS Rust workspace dependency graph
    accDescr: The workspace is a layered DAG. zettings-core defines the domain model and depends on nothing internal. zettings-ipc, zettings-bus, zettings-polkit, zettings-plugin-sdk, and zettings-search each depend only on core. The zettings application shell depends on all of them and contains no domain logic.
    CORE["zettings-core<br/>domain model"]
    IPC["zettings-ipc<br/>typed contracts + TS bindings"]
    BUS["zettings-bus<br/>event bus"]
    POL["zettings-polkit<br/>authorization gateway"]
    SDK["zettings-plugin-sdk<br/>manifests + signatures"]
    SRCH["zettings-search<br/>ranking kernel"]
    APP["apps/zettings<br/>Tauri shell (commands)"]
    CORE --> IPC
    CORE --> BUS
    CORE --> POL
    CORE --> SDK
    CORE --> SRCH
    IPC --> APP
    BUS --> APP
    POL --> APP
    SDK --> APP
    SRCH --> APP
